name: Diagram evidence plans finite discovery and preserves context and navigation
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR SEMGREP_APP_TOKEN SEMGREP_AGENT_TOKEN
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/dfd_study.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: run threat-model:import {"path":".kuzushi/manual-context.json","label":"Beta","activate":true}
require-live-snap: 30 threat-model:import saved | active-beta
submit: map
require-live-snap: 25 SYSTEM SUMMARY | beta-map
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 Map ✓ | accepted-beta
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/dfd_study.py @TMP_TARGET @ART mapped
submit: use sast
submit: options sast:scan
submit: set taskMode manual
submit: set tasks semgrep
paste-file: @ART/rule-setting.txt
keys: Enter
submit: set semgrepTimeoutMs 60000
submit: map
require-live-snap: 20 SYSTEM SUMMARY | map-return
nav-mode:
keys: Tab z
require-live-snap: 20 s plan scan | diagram-action
resize: 160x48
live-snap: action-160x48
expect: s plan scan
resize: 96x89
live-snap: action-96x89
expect: s plan scan
resize: 80x24
live-snap: action-80x24
expect: s plan scan
resize: 60x20
live-snap: action-60x20
expect: s plan scan
resize: 40x12
live-snap: action-40x12
expect: s plan scan
expect: f findings
expect: back
ask: Are selection, saved findings, scan planning, context inspection and Back discoverable across all six terminal sizes?
resize: 120x36
keys: s
require-live-snap: 20 repository file evidence | missing-evidence
keys: Escape
nav-mode:
keys: Down s
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | beta-draft-only
expect: No jobs started
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 s plan scan | returned-beta-diagram
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/dfd_study.py @TMP_TARGET @ART navigation
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | parent-study
keys: Enter
type: 5
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 5 passes · 1 worker(s) | parent-five-passes
keys: Down Down Down Enter Up Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | inspected-inactive-alpha
expect: Alpha
keys: v Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 COMPONENT · Alpha receiver | selected-alpha-context
keys: s
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | alpha-child
expect: Three passes, one worker
expect: No jobs started
expect: 2 exact source paths
expect: " app /lib.py"
resize: 160x48
live-snap: child-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: child-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: child-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: child-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: child-40x12
keys: z Home
live-snap: child-reader-40x12-first
keys: NPage
live-snap: child-reader-40x12-middle
keys: End
live-snap: child-reader-40x12-last
ask: Can the operator inspect the proposed paths, selected immutable context, three-pass workload and separate approval through all six plan layouts and the complete narrow reader?
keys: z
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 COMPONENT · Alpha receiver | exact-parent-return
expect: Element: api
ask: Does Back restore the inspected inactive context and selected evidence, while keeping the earlier five-pass draft separate from the new three-pass proposal?
keys: s
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | new-explicit-proposal
keys: Enter Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | child-context
keys: v Down s
require-live-snap: 20 No nested work added | nested-proposal-refused
keys: Escape Escape
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | child-form-return
keys: Down Down Enter
type: 1
keys: Enter Down Enter
type: 1
keys: Enter L
require-live-snap: 35 Draft ready | three-job-plan
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/dfd_study.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
keys: L Home
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW PLAN & ALLOWANCE | allowance-review
expect: 3 fixed jobs
expect: Total provider calls: 1
expect: Protected review calls: 1
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 y approve | specific-approval
keys: y
require-live-snap: 25 Approval saved | approved-three-jobs
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 L starts its fixed jobs | approved-job-browser
expect: diagram
ask: Does the job browser keep a visible return to the original diagram and require a separate launch after exact work and allowance approval?
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 dispatcher pid | launched
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/dfd_study.py @TMP_TARGET @ART completed
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 3 completed | finished
keys: q
require-live-snap: 20 COMPONENT · Alpha receiver | completed-return-to-parent
expect: Element: api
keys: Escape Escape
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | retained-parent-study
expect: 5 passes · 1 worker(s)
ask: After actual discovery, does returning retain the original diagram, context selection and five-pass parent draft without starting its work or scanning other files?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 3 completed | recovered-fixed-work
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Scan | completed-scan
nav-mode:
keys: n
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Review | accepted-scan
paste-file: @ART/open-spaced.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 print("OWNER_POLICY_REVIEW") | literal-source
expect-not: live source missing or changed
submit: decision deferred Spaced source owner review
paste-file: @ART/open-plain.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 FINDING | second-source
submit: decision deferred Ordinary source owner review
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Evidence: 6 producer observations | faithful-report
keys: j j j
require-live-snap: 20 format json (4/6) | json-format
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | exported
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/dfd_study.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exported
ask: Does no-color restart retain the three completed jobs, six observations and two deferred findings, with the inactive context frozen and global Beta unchanged?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
